<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <title>Ekkula Sustainable Tourism Awards Nomination</title>
</head>
<body style="font-family: Arial, sans-serif; background-color: #f4f4f4; margin: 0; padding: 0;">

<!-- Container table to center content -->
<table width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" bgcolor="#f4f4f4">
    <tr>
        <td align="center">
            <!-- Header table with logo -->
            <table width="600" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0"  >
                <tr>
                    <td style="text-align: left;">
                        <img src="https://ekkula.ateiug.com/assets/img/logo.webp" alt="Ekkula Sustainable Tourism Awards" width="200">
                    </td>
                    <td style="text-align: right;">
                        <p style="font-size: 18px; color: #ffcc00;">Ekkula Sustainable Tourism Awards</p>
                    </td>
                </tr>
            </table>
        </td>
    </tr>
</table>

<!-- Second content table -->
<table width="100%" cellpadding="20" cellspacing="0"  >
    <tr>
        <td>
            <h2>Ekkula Sustainable Tourism Awards - Nomination Details</h2>
            <p>Hello Ekkula Nomination Department,</p>
            <p>A nomination has been received for the Ekkula Sustainable Tourism Awards. Please find the details below:</p>
            <ul>
                <li><strong>User's Name:</strong> <%=  userName %></li>
                <li><strong>Nominee's Name:</strong> <%=  nomineeName %></li>
                <li><strong>Category:</strong> <%=  category %></li>
                <li><strong>Reason for Nomination:</strong> <%=  reason %></li>
            </ul>
            <p>Please review this nomination and consider it for the upcoming awards.</p>
            <p>For any inquiries or additional information, please contact the user at <%=  userEmail %>.</p>
            <p>Best regards,</p>
            <p>The Ekkula Sustainable Tourism Awards Team</p>
        </td>
    </tr>
</table>

<!-- Footer table -->
<table width="100%" cellpadding="20" cellspacing="0" bgcolor="#f4f4f4">
    <tr>
        <td>
            <p style="color: #666;">© 2024 Ekkula Sustainable Tourism Awards. All rights reserved.</p>
        </td>
    </tr>
</table>

</body>
</html>
